    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d273">

                <pb facs="0469" n="375" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg375"/>

                <head>No. 273.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pendleton to Mr. Bayard</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-04-16"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 16, 1886</date>.
                        (Received May 3.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 245.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have received from the Imperial foreign
                    office the note dated April 4, 1886, in reference to the case of Knud Nielsen
                    Knudsen, of which I inclose copy and translation, a copy of my note of
                    intervention having been transmitted to the Department with my dispatch<anchor
                        n="*" xml:id="d273-f1"/> No. 214, of the 23d ultimo.</p>
                <p>It seemed to me that the time and occasion were opportune to present in very
                    definite form the views contained in your instruction No. 106, of the substance
                    of which I had made a statement to Count Bismarck in a conversation of an
                    earlier date. Accordingly, I prepared the note to the foreign office of April
                    10, 1886, of which I also inclose a copy, and sent it with a copy of your No.
                    106. I hope my note and action will meet your approval.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Geo. H.
                    Pendleton.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d273-a1.xml" xpointer="d273-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d273-a2.xml" xpointer="d273-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
